{
  "map": "UndeadRE01",
  "title": "Arcane Sanctuary",
  "locale": "zhTW",
  "note": "Blizzard's order from conversation.json (trigger groups as listed, lines by conversationOrder).",
  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "這是什麼地方？",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1143,
        "speaker_string_id": 1144,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-C010-010-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "安雅",
      "text": "這是由法師建立的異次元空間，專門存放廢物。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1152,
        "speaker_string_id": 1153,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-C010-020-ANYA"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "安雅",
      "text": "果然不出我所料，這裡面充滿了守護者造物，搞不好還布滿了陷阱。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1161,
        "speaker_string_id": 1162,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-C010-030-ANYA"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "安雅",
      "text": "我們得利用傳送門來探索這廳堂。希望最後能找到什麼好東西，值得我們費盡這麼多苦心。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1169,
        "speaker_string_id": 1170,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-C010-040-ANYA"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "看來這與傳送門的外框相容。這肯定是我們所需的能量來源。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 873,
        "speaker_string_id": 874,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-T020-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "這道傳送門好像動不了。或許需要能量來源。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 848,
        "speaker_string_id": 849,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-T010-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "安雅",
      "text": "這些可惡的法師就愛耍小花招。我們得沿原路折返了。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 908,
        "speaker_string_id": 909,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-T030-ANYA"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "如果我們能將阻礙路徑的障礙物移除，這道光束或許能啟動下一道傳送門。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 950,
        "speaker_string_id": 951,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-T040-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "安雅",
      "text": "是幻象！真正的神器肯定藏在寶庫的某處。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 992,
        "speaker_string_id": 993,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-T050-ANYA"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "我們得繼續尋找。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 994,
        "speaker_string_id": 995,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-T060-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "看來這就是真正的神器。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 998,
        "speaker_string_id": 999,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-T070-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "安雅",
      "text": "終於。我們把這該死的東西帶回去給萊克斯頓吧。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1006,
        "speaker_string_id": 1007,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-T080-ANYA"
      }
    }
  ]
}